  "name": "AndroidAPS",
  "alternateName": [
    "AAPS"
  ],
  "description": "Open-source automated insulin delivery (AID) system for Android implementing the OpenAPS oref0/oref1 algorithm. Manages insulin pump communication, CGM data ingestion, and automated basal rate adjustments and bolus calculations for type 1 diabetes closed-loop therapy. Supports 30+ insulin pumps (Dana, Accu-Chek Combo/Insight, Omnipod Eros/DASH, Medtronic, EOPatch) and all major CGM systems (Dexcom G5/G6/G7, Libre, Medtronic Enlite). Includes oref1 features: unannounced meals (UAM), super micro bolus (SMB), and dynamic ISF/CR. AGPL-3.0, 1.1k stars with 4.9k forks reflecting wide community deployment, v3.4.2.2 (April 2026). Studied in the CREATE randomised controlled trial (NEJM 2022) demonstrating significant improvement in time-in-range vs standard care. Part of the Nightscout / #WeAreNotWaiting community.",
