  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The leading open-source AID system for Android, with NEJM-level clinical evidence from the CREATE RCT (2022) demonstrating improved time-in-range vs standard care. 4.9k forks reflects extraordinary real-world deployment. oref0/oref1 algorithm supports unannounced meals (UAM) and super micro bolus (SMB), with 30+ pump integrations. AGPL-3.0 is OSI-approved but copyleft — embedding in proprietary apps requires attention. Adopt for diabetes research teams and clinical programmes supporting open-source AID.",
